Hence, the following:
ORDER i) MFA No.9989/2010 is partly allowed and MFA Crob.63/2011 is hereby dismissed;
- 17 - ii) The total compensation awarded by the Tribunal is modified and petitioners are entitled to a total compensation of Rs.11,18,000/- along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of filing of the petition before the Tribunal till the date of realization;
iii) Respondent No.2 shall pay the said amount to the petitioners along with due interest thereon within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of the certified copy of the judgment and order and it shall have the liberty to recover the amount paid to the petitioners from respondent No.1-owner;
iv) Compensation amount will be apportioned between the petitioners on the terms of Tribunal order;
v) Amount in deposit, if any, shall stand transferred to the concerned Tribunal for disbursement in favour of the petitioners;
vi) Draw modified award accordingly;
